Feature: Booking Privacy

  Scenario Outline: Another driver cannot see my booking details
    Given I am a driver
    And I book that slot for a valid container
    Then the booking is confirmed with a reference "<booking_ref>"
    
    When another driver looks up my booking with reference "<booking_ref>"
    Then they are told it does not exist

    Examples:
      | booking_ref |
      | "ABCD1234"  |

  Scenario Outline: Booking lookup fails for non-existent references
    Given I am a driver
    
    When another driver looks up my booking with reference "<nonexistent_ref>"
    Then they are told it does not exist

    Examples:
      | nonexistent_ref |
      | "XYZ789"        |
